<title>UK: DePfa adds 1.0 bln marks to June 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>DePfa adds 1.0 bln marks to June 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 2.0 billion marks from 1.0 billion marks, joint lead managers Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commerzbank, DG Bank and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT  **2.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    14.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.79     PAY DATE  S 13.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     LISTING    FFT	 S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> NOTES	**ORIGINAL 1.0 BLN DEM LAUNCHED 23.JAN AT 99.05</p>
<p>DENOMS (K) ONE -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
